               correlated to dsDNA (r = 0.127, p < 0.001) and CitH3 (r = 0.102,
               p = 0.003). After a median follow-up time of 4.6 years, 184 (21.3
               \%) patients had reached a clinical endpoint. TCC was not
               associated with the composite endpoint, but with total mortality
