               briefing and candidate disease identification. We observed that
               the highly efficient-interlinked genes connected with ACADS are
               HAHDA, HADHB, ECHS1 and ACAT1. Interestingly, the ontological
               aspect of genes in the ACADS network reveals that ACADS, HAHDA
