              and Zhang, Xiao-Dan and Qian, Jian-Chang",
  journal  = "Int. Immunopharmacol.",
  volume   =  155,
  pages    =  114631,
  abstract = "SGLT1/2 dual-target inhibitors have demonstrated significant
              benefits for diabetic patients, particularly those with
              cardiovascular complications. However, pharmacological mechanisms
              beyond SGLT1/2 inhibition remain incompletely understood. The
              current study investigated the effects of sotagliflozin, a
