  journal  = "Metabolism",
  volume   =  168,
  pages    =  156262,
  abstract = "Objective: Obesity-induced mechanical changes in white adipose
              tissue (WAT), including adipocyte hypertrophy and fibrosis, are
              hypothesized to alter adipose tissue macrophage (ATM) function
              through mechanosensitive pathways. This study aimed to determine
              whether the mechanosensor Piezo1 in ATMs regulates
