              Methods: To investigate macrophage Piezo1 in obesity,
              myeloid-specific Piezo1-deficient mice (Piezo1Δlyz2) and
              littermate controls (Piezo1flox/+) were fed a high-fat diet (HFD)
              to induce obesity for 12 weeks. Metabolic assessments (GTT/ITT),
              tissue analyses (H\&E staining, micro-CT), and RNA-seq were
              performed. Bone marrow transplantation and co-culture experiments
              (BMDMs with 3T3L1 adipocytes/PC12 neurons) were performed to
