               aneurysms and several other cardiovascular diseases. Restoring
               the levels of specialized proresolving mediators to drive the
               chronic cardiovascular inflammation toward resolution is emerging
               as a novel therapeutic principle. The lipid mediators lipoxins
               and resolvins exert their proresolving actions through specific
               G-protein coupled receptors (GPCR). So far, four GPCR have been
